758", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056894201", "personaname": "Borles", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198056894201/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 870, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 870, "last_played": 1763587367, "avatar": "da30241def33fad6261a7996dbd3aa5609faf44e"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a good time capsule and a classic, but it's not quite up to snuff by today's rogue-like standards, which, notably, it did help set. There's some great fun to be had, but I'd say it's much more RNG-dependent that its successor. Not every run will be as workable as you might hope, and there's some of that good-old-fashioned beat-your-head-against-the-wall rogue-like grind until you get a good run. Be sure to mess with your scaling and zoom to see what feels right, as the default settings are gonna make the game way too tiny to see well, and be prepared for a tough learning curve with the movement and controls. But, most importantly, if you keep dying, try not getting hit.\n\nThough I haven't played Risk of Rain Returns, I'd recommend checking it out if you're wanting to try this game and coming from RoR 2, or this decade, and haven't played the original before.", "timestamp_created": 1763588096, "timestamp_updated": 1763588096, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209573814", "author": {"steamid": "76561198243297366", "personaname": "Chadnik", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Chadnik/", "num_games_owned": 489, "num_reviews": 133, "playtime_forever": 69, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 36, "last_played": 1763507227, "avatar": "6cb6815d0c2055f134c1f6924dea81950fab7273"}, "language": "english", "review": "ass game, controls feel ♥♥♥♥, rng only no skill required", "timestamp_created": 1763503618, "timestamp_updated": 1763503618, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.405257731676101685", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "208964223", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006668610", "personaname": "Deville", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198006668610/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 36, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 36, "last_played": 1762875305, "avatar": "9bcb672447de91f3cb6ab1c186d6712e59435f4b"}, "language": "english", "review": "i don't understand how this is supposed to be fun. It controls horribly, you can not point in a direction to shoot, only shoot straight in 1 direction, things blow past you so you shoot the wrong way, things spawn constantly, things attack at angles, you can not shoot at angles. You are asked to pick between items you have no idea what they are, and the \"survive for 90 seconds\" is not survive for 90 seconds, because then you have to kill everything, and if the game spawned 57 creatures, screw you i guess.\nWhat the hell?\nI love rogue likes, but this ... just sucked ... i don't understand how it keeps appearing on lists of games you should try.\nFirst go, ... Removed game, can not imagine ever wanting to try this again.", "timestamp_created": 1762875834, "timestamp_updated": 1762875834, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.344364702701568604", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, 